# Convex writes CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT + CONVEX_URL into brain/.env.local on `npx convex dev`.
# Share that CONVEX_URL with the other lanes (screens/, eyes/) — that is the deployment they connect to.

# Agent-side secrets are read from process.env INSIDE Convex actions, so they must be set as
# Convex deployment env vars (NOT in this file, which never reaches the deployment):
#
#   npx convex env set LLM_PROVIDER gemini
#   npx convex env set GEMINI_API_KEY <paid-key>
#   npx convex env set GEMINI_MODEL gemini-2.5-flash
#
# To flip every agent to OpenAI later (the insurance path), it's config, not code:
#   npx convex env set LLM_PROVIDER openai
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_API_KEY <key>
